-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Quest</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">12.40.9997<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 13, 2020<br/>Summer Update 2020</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>Help <a href=\"#/wiki/Goshnar\">Goshnar</a> defeat the manifestation of his evil traits and earn the right to wear the Revenant Outfits.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>All the locations of the <a href=\"#/quest/soul-war-quest\">Soul War Quest</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p>Creatures and bosses found in the <a href=\"#/quest/soul-war-quest\">Soul War Quest</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Revenant%20Outfits\">Revenant Outfits</a> and addons, <a href=\"#/wiki/Achievements\">achievement</a>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Unleash%20the%20Beast\">Unleash the Beast</a> <br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Revenant%20Outfits\"><img alt=\"Revenant Outfits\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Revenant_Male_Addon_3_68c3a2.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Revenant%20Outfits\"><img alt=\"Revenant Outfits\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Revenant_Female_Addon_3_869092.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Base_Outfits\">Base Outfits</span></h2>\n<p>Finish <a href=\"#/quest/soul-war-quest\">Soul War Quest</a> by defeating <a href=\"#/wiki/Goshnar%27s%20Megalomania\">Goshnar's Megalomania</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-First_Addon\">First Addon</span></h2>\n<p>Use <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Skull%20of%20a%20Beast\"><img alt=\"The Skull of a Beast\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/The_Skull_of_a_Beast_9402e8.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Skull%20of%20a%20Beast\">The Skull of a Beast</a>.<br/>\nYou will get the following message:<br/>\n<span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">Now the beast is unleashed!</span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Second_Addon\">Second Addon</span></h2>\n<p>Use a <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Bracelet%20of%20Strengthening\"><img alt=\"Bracelet of Strengthening\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bracelet_of_Strengthening_2c8869.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Bracelet%20of%20Strengthening\">Bracelet of Strengthening</a>.<br/>\nYou will get the following message:<br/>\n<span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">Wild power flows though your body!</span>\n</p><p>Upon using both items you will get the achievement <a href=\"#/wiki/Unleash%20the%20Beast\">Unleash the Beast</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>","quests":["soul-war-quest"]}